  "remarks": "Anna Molchanova is the Head of the regional branch of the “Movement of the First” in the city of Sevastopol. Anna Molchanova actively participates in the indoctrination, russification, and militarisation of Ukrainian minors in Sevastopol, Crimea. Under Anna Molchanova’s leadership, new local units of the “Movement of the First” were opened in schools. As the regional leader of the “Movement of the First”, Anna Molchanova actively supports policies focused on military and patriotic education, in particular for minors, with the aim of instilling admiration for the Russian Federation, its symbols, and its narratives, and supports activities related to the glorification of the Russian army. In her position, Anna Molchanova also actively cooperates with other military-patriotic organisations, such as Yunarmiya and the Defenders of the Fatherland Foundation. Her branch of the “Movement of the First” was among those that organised the patriotic-military game Zarnitsa 2.0 for schoolchildren, which included tasks such as assembling and disassembling Kalashnikov rifles.",
